@startuml
!theme plain
start
:Admin or Beat triggers weekly report;
:07 checks matchweek + standings;
:06 generates from source facts;
:07 stores draft in PostgreSQL;
:Admin reviews / edits through 02;
:Admin publishes through 02 -> 07;
:07 coordinates KB upsert and published status;
fork
:05 indexes published report;
fork again
:07 -> 02 -> 01 exposes published report;
fork again
:02 stores admin audit;
end fork
stop
@enduml
